# LAKEZ Admin Panel — Complete Project Structure
# Last Updated: August 2026

=================================================
## TECH STACK
=================================================

FRONTEND:
- Framework: Flutter Web
- State Management: Riverpod
- Architecture: Clean Architecture + Feature First
- Build Command: flutter build web --release
- Run Command: npx serve build\web
- URL: http://localhost:3000

BACKEND:
- Firebase Authentication (Email + Password)
- Cloud Firestore (Database)
- Firebase Storage (Images/Files)
- Firebase Messaging (Push Notifications)
- No Cloud Functions yet (Direct Firestore writes)

DATABASE:
- Cloud Firestore (NoSQL)
- Real-time updates via snapshots()
- Security Rules: request.auth != null

COURIER:
- Steadfast API (Sandbox mode)
- API Key stored in Firestore (NOT in code)
- Collection: merchants/LAKEZ_MAIN_MERCHANT

PAYMENT:
- COD (Cash on Delivery)
- bKash
- Nagad

=================================================
## HOW IT WORKS
=================================================

Flutter Web App
↓
Firebase Authentication (Login)
↓
Cloud Firestore (Read/Write data)
↓
Firebase Storage (Upload images)
↓
Steadfast API (Courier - via Firestore config)

Data Flow:
Admin Action → Flutter → Firestore → Real-time update → UI

