## IMPORTANT DECISIONS
=================================================

1. Single Merchant Account
   → merchantId: LAKEZ_MAIN_MERCHANT
   → All sellers use same Steadfast account

2. API Keys Security
   → Never in code
   → Stored in Firestore: merchants/LAKEZ_MAIN_MERCHANT

3. Size System
   → Added at Main Category level
   → Auto-inherited to Sub + Second Sub

4. Order Flow
   → New Order → Admin Approval → Release to Seller
   → Seller cannot see order until Admin approves

5. Settlement
   → NOT automatic
   → Admin manually releases payment
   → Commission auto-calculated per seller rate

6. Customer Restriction
   → Level 0-5 system
   → Level 0: All benefits (new customer default)
   → Level 5: Full ban

7. Build Method
   → flutter build web --release
   → npx serve build\web
   → http://localhost:3000

8. No Cloud Functions yet
   → All operations direct from Flutter to Firestore
   → Cloud Functions needed later for: auto-settlement, notifications, fraud detection

